{"c":[{"id":"023ef6d783b9ba73","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum. SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet (proofs stay; 3.11 floor because CI has no 3.10). Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines. slobac-audit-ratchet archived PR #48 (findings 14, 60-63 kept).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"445d51b96a604dfb","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum; leftover .sum is not a caption. SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet applied (proofs stay; 3.11 floor because CI has no 3.10). Consumer .sum→.summ find recipe was on PR #47.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fadfed630d13aa36","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum; leftover .sum beside a .tree is not a caption. Consumer find recipe is on PR #47 for the squash BREAKING CHANGES footer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T153120Z-33fb53e74d638a8e","text":"Nap caption files are .summ; a leftover .sum beside a .tree is not a caption.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T160856Z-79b76d35d66fe702","text":"summ-caption-suffix archived: captions are .summ; consumer find recipe on PR #47 for squash BREAKING CHANGES.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7d9b22491a29a836","sum":"SLOBAC 2026-08-25 audit (284 tests) found 63 smells; ratchet applied. Proofs stay as file-backend acceptance; the 3.11-floor pin stays because CI has no 3.10.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T174056Z-e79674666263e761","text":"2026-08-25 SLOBAC all-smells audit of tests/ (284 tests): 63 deduplicated findings; largest clusters loose-text-oracle 30, vacuous-assertion 12, implementation-coupled 10; cross-suite confirmed 4 redundancies and proof-file fossils.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T180628Z-7d45f92e68433516","text":"SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet applied to tests: proofs kept as file-backend acceptance; CI has no 3.10 so the source-order 3.11-floor pin stays.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"81969101cc5f4d48","sum":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines. slobac-audit-ratchet archived (19 fixes, PR #48; findings 14, 60-63 kept). Perf @5k: wake ~1ms, startup ~120ms, heal 81ms, recall short_id 19s, catalog walk 44ms vs ls-files 2.5ms","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a4ec8912daa1494d","sum":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines; tox py311-py314 was 284.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T181644Z-3f292cfab0ac6216","text":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*: worktree merge, caption conflict, squash-clone zoom, nap reject, branch-pack merge, path walk-up and catalog. First proof N gone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T185219Z-e6bb937a75148bd1","text":"QA PASS: test_zoom_expanded_child_id pins the selected nap's exact two public wake lines; tox py311-py314 each pass 284 tests.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"aa3c608f961e94cc","sum":"slobac-audit-ratchet archived: 19 fixes + PR #48 zoom pin; findings 14 and 60-63 kept. Perf audit @5k: wake ~1ms; startup ~120ms; heal 81ms/note; recall short_id 19s; catalog walk 44ms vs git ls-files 2.5ms","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T185552Z-c63aabf42fe2467f","text":"slobac-audit-ratchet archived: 19 ratchet fixes + Phase A rename + PR #48 zoom pin; findings 14 and 60-63 kept; memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260825-slobac-audit-ratchet.md","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T191431Z-3c64d129c6c9a0bb","text":"Perf audit: wake view ~1ms@5k leaves. Costs: ~120ms startup (compile 29ms; dataclasses/argparse/tomllib imports), heal reparses every .tree per note (81ms@5k), recall per-line short_id rescan (19s@5k common word), catalog os.walk+check-ignore 44ms vs git ls-files 2.5ms","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"107070bb94d80d9b","sum":"Perf shards: catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree once; named_ids shares that walk. Heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize/write_nap build Tree. Wave #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"78d34186f9c1d621","sum":"Perf shards #49/#50: catalog via one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Wave was #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0302e7603c8f235a","sum":"Perf shards filed: #49 catalog ls-files, #50 recall/zoom prefix+parse-once, #51 heal raw-JSON, #52 drop-dataclasses, #53 skip-heal (design). Wave #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52; close/defer ok.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T192652Z-f5aecd1900237e75","text":"Perf shards filed: #49 catalog ls-files, #50 recall/zoom prefix+parse-once, #51 heal raw-JSON walk, #52 startup dataclasses/lazy-import, #53 skip-heal marker (design)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T193539Z-a762122c1565c2e3","text":"perf-shards L4: #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52; parent operator; close/defer ok; parent L4 files stay off main until capstone.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f05f9b5376fd649a","sum":"Issues #49/#50: catalog via one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T193914Z-a87c411d06c19c31","text":"Issue #50: recall/zoom unique-prefix once per command (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Catalog/heal/dataclasses stay out.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T193954Z-611094457cb3dfa9","text":"Issue #49 plan: catalog_text becomes one git ls-files -z --cached --others --exclude-standard filtered for .summem/config.toml; _ignored_store goes away.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3def4ffb3ddeacd7","sum":"Catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once and parse each view .tree once (#50). Heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree (#51/#56).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fb6c804b59655564","sum":"catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once and parse each view .tree once (#50).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T195218Z-f3eba96c79b9d954","text":"Root catalog enumerates via one git ls-files --cached --others --exclude-standard filtered on .summem/config.toml; no committed index.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T200439Z-dff2e8353bdc9000","text":"recall-zoom-prefix archived: recall/zoom unique-prefix once per command (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Issue #50.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f3a4c22a002e4dd6","sum":"heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree. PR #56 Fixes #51.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T200855Z-2670ea812d7405e3","text":"Issue #51: heal digest walk is raw JSON only; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree when writing a pack.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T202339Z-0c3a676acf423f91","text":"Heal overlap checks walk raw tree JSON; note/nap thread one list_view and knobs. PR #56 Fixes #51.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
